  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不管是到過或沒有到過杭州的人，只須是受過幾年中學教育的，你倘若問他：“杭州城裏有什麼大自然的好景？”",
      "output_sha256": "95ff08afbe9acaaf8f85374224c3d1a0bdb0ed111e3aaf93954aad595b360e3b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "95ff08afbe9acaaf8f85374224c3d1a0bdb0ed111e3aaf93954aad595b360e3b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "他們一定會毫不猶豫地回答“西湖”！",
      "output_sha256": "781e0416ab07a215f90d7c96a2fb06a0ba73daa0658ec3f6a5ba2b28b02f1eaf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.512116,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7e8b9f5c57bac0830e959af739a2506065ef80cca356ea9e41012595b2b826e1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "781e0416ab07a215f90d7c96a2fb06a0ba73daa0658ec3f6a5ba2b28b02f1eaf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "其實西湖卻是在從前的杭州城外的，以其在杭城之西而得名。",
      "output_sha256": "d57a0d7dafe47f2335c66c24a9d7f1f0a1626a53fee4f9e678e2b54f40cbb7ca",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "d57a0d7dafe47f2335c66c24a9d7f1f0a1626a53fee4f9e678e2b54f40cbb7ca",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "真正在杭州城裏的大觀，第一要推吳山（俗名城隍山），可是現在來杭州的遊客，大半總不加以注意；就是住在杭州的本地人，也一年之中去不得幾次，這纔是奇事。",
      "output_sha256": "7998f4cd9f177f2066c29df0f7b9a20f663afacc7f95de60cb57a4d30affae1e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "7998f4cd9f177f2066c29df0f7b9a20f663afacc7f95de60cb57a4d30affae1e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "我這一回來稱頌吳山，若說得僭一點，也可以說是“我的杭州城的發見”，以效My discovery of London之顰；不過吳山在辛亥革命以前，久已經是杭州唯一的遊賞之地，現在的發見，原也只是重翻舊帳而已。",
      "output_sha256": "c35da8cbe58b444f38fae1c36e872af342a95067db7da21bd97e5111cb2ae0c9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "c35da8cbe58b444f38fae1c36e872af342a95067db7da21bd97e5111cb2ae0c9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "吳山，春秋時爲吳南界，以別於越，故曰吳山。",
      "output_sha256": "9ecaca4a876816404ecb76e3306145a3d615d58f3a44fd0bae897473036b9e57",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "9ecaca4a876816404ecb76e3306145a3d615d58f3a44fd0bae897473036b9e57",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "有說法認為是因伍子胥之故，將伍誤作吳，因此《郡志》也稱之為胥山，位於鎮海樓（即鼓樓）右側。",
      "output_sha256": "d18ca099407b7e3a4e13c8ef0007726600ad941ce27c40ad951f351b795d93fb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.475014,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "8d41dcf3707bc6dd9a90da4b0b2ca371328c81d423b90bffaff49b98e46809ff"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d18ca099407b7e3a4e13c8ef0007726600ad941ce27c40ad951f351b795d93fb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "蓋天目爲杭州諸山之宗，翔舞而東，結局於鳳凰山；其支山左折，遂爲吳山；派分西北，爲寶月爲蛾眉，爲竹園；稍南爲石佛，爲七寶，爲金地，爲瑞石，爲寶蓮，爲清平，總曰吳山。",
      "output_sha256": "5cd51894fde102536183d20f63f2ffd7ce6c9893f0c0317fe536ce2e9f3121f3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "5cd51894fde102536183d20f63f2ffd7ce6c9893f0c0317fe536ce2e9f3121f3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "這是田叔禾在《西湖遊覽志》卷十二中對吳山的記載。",
      "output_sha256": "95b81f626712e83e7b0fcbba09b85b50c60db6a8c4c76f79909e1eaf69184651",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.648191,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9,
        10,
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "a7f878b8ced1a7957c560d573e30ddbbc1696e38c370513aacbbf4bff12e7f43",
        "f88c1b7702d3affe04d46bc2e4f564a53906093e8636090e19848564f1b83aea",
        "5532e7c476fd26f0a444a4cbb2c390be54740b959c29466963f93586f3160158"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "95b81f626712e83e7b0fcbba09b85b50c60db6a8c4c76f79909e1eaf69184651",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "二十餘年前，杭州人說是出遊，總以這吳山爲目的；腳力不繼的人，也要出吳山的腳下，上涌金門外三雅園等地方去喝茶；自辛亥革命以來，旗營全毀，城牆拆了，遊人就集中在湖濱，不再有上城隍山去消磨半日光明的事情了。",
      "output_sha256": "ef56793349b49cfcd36e81bf3c49772f58240de4fef2ca62d69678afb77f303e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "ef56793349b49cfcd36e81bf3c49772f58240de4fef2ca62d69678afb77f303e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "吳山的好處，第一在它的近，第二在它的並不高，元時平章答剌罕脫歡所甃的那數百級的石級，走走並不費力。",
      "output_sha256": "c6ec8d20c6efffe726f4f4fa120307945d17ce64c5671b523bdf45e22fad2e0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "c6ec8d20c6efffe726f4f4fa120307945d17ce64c5671b523bdf45e22fad2e0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "可是一到頂上，掉頭四顧，卻可以看得見滄海的日出，錢塘江江上的帆行，西興的煙樹，城裏的人家；西湖只像一面圓鏡，到城隍山上去俯看下來，卻不見得有趣，不見得嬌美了。",
      "output_sha256": "58cc1c164145879b7cfcab8b5fae4ec32927dc9b48cb46de2105a33dcc937139",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "58cc1c164145879b7cfcab8b5fae4ec32927dc9b48cb46de2105a33dcc937139",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "還有一件吳山特有的好處，是這山上的怪石的特多；你若從東面上山，一直的向南向西，沿嶺脊走去，在路上有十幾處可以看到這些神工鬼斧的奇巖怪石。",
      "output_sha256": "072b21f29ec398506c4768da816c531a394691c40201e4be60b1f95e5d04a148",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_human_sha256": "072b21f29ec398506c4768da816c531a394691c40201e4be60b1f95e5d04a148",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "假山難以比擬這樣的巧妙，真山也絕無如此的秀美。",
      "output_sha256": "006d07f94613d79e7ca335d01529ed9150c83c4dfd8535e557078feb7dc44d80",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.594735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7fcf0dd1469a8ce13a8119494123a178972585d1df181b1c05e89bdcf7a028ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "006d07f94613d79e7ca335d01529ed9150c83c4dfd8535e557078feb7dc44d80",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "而環繞著江湖、碧空四周，僧廬道院、畫閣雕欄、茂林修竹、塵市炊煙等景物，卻仍然是不足掛齒的附帶之物。",
      "output_sha256": "719abbacbf57c6a974286a9175b5872a186c6fab8243909c6a4726f17d3705e9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.594735,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7fcf0dd1469a8ce13a8119494123a178972585d1df181b1c05e89bdcf7a028ea"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "719abbacbf57c6a974286a9175b5872a186c6fab8243909c6a4726f17d3705e9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14,
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "再者，當前的吳山對我而言，較之從前更添韻味的，便是遊客的稀少。",
      "output_sha256": "c8dbaf10966fe4015769d5e049e56acafbeed31727813ae75eec4e64c0278d00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.513642,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "dbd16559240eb285b9ad54de61faf11fab0b37ce6af9bda0df1bfbc4524f8ccd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c8dbaf10966fe4015769d5e049e56acafbeed31727813ae75eec4e64c0278d00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "大約上吳山去的，總以春秋二節的燒香客爲限；一般的遊人，尤其是老住在杭州的我所認識的許多朋友，平時決不會去的。",
      "output_sha256": "903469ce3a91bffdb15495e190f0e86e7c0bc2d4bc94ff240efb4166a8ed7e50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "903469ce3a91bffdb15495e190f0e86e7c0bc2d4bc94ff240efb4166a8ed7e50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "鄉下的燒香客，在香市裏雖則擁擠不堪，可是因爲我和他們並不相識，所以雖處在稠人廣衆之中，我還可以盡情地享受我的孤獨。",
      "output_sha256": "04d90a0c5d3338c205afe84cbc4b6936f6a0a6db21514f4650a6ca3dbf36be4f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "04d90a0c5d3338c205afe84cbc4b6936f6a0a6db21514f4650a6ca3dbf36be4f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "自遷到杭州來後，這城隍山的一角，彷彿是變了我的野外的情人；凡遇到胸懷悒鬱，工作倦頹，或風雨晦暝，氣候不正的時候，只消上山去走它半天，喝一碗茶兩杯酒，坐兩三個鐘頭，就可以恢復元氣，爽颯地回來，好像是洗了一個澡。",
      "output_sha256": "e75e0dce0021cc79c8fded5b66cd9dc298178eff0520ae4f6193bc32a60e89bd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "e75e0dce0021cc79c8fded5b66cd9dc298178eff0520ae4f6193bc32a60e89bd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "去年元日，我曾去登山，今年元日也按例而行；此外，每當遇到節日，或是稍微閒暇之時，即使心中沒有任何煩悶，我也會獨自一人踱上山去，靜坐半天。",
      "output_sha256": "0a87e39c35131302e9413b8b1546c4f4b30be43dfcb22ba61ef8a69f3b1907ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.556226,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "49586b0825d7ff9c0b5548b77d47e1a418c144587128535cff06be07063fb86f"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0a87e39c35131302e9413b8b1546c4f4b30be43dfcb22ba61ef8a69f3b1907ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "前次語堂來杭，我陪他走了半天城隍山後，他也看出了這山的好處來了，我們還談到了集資買地，來造它一個俱樂部的事情。",
      "output_sha256": "789dc092e007f9a9c02af2bbb0b214b6572f254994fcc31c9f5149fc4690ed5a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_human_sha256": "789dc092e007f9a9c02af2bbb0b214b6572f254994fcc31c9f5149fc4690ed5a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "大約在吳山上興建，並不是難事，只需五千元，便可用一千元購地，四千元建屋，便能成功；可惜的是，幾處最佳地點已被有權有勢、不懂山水的人佔據，我們若想進入，只能在南山下購幾方土地，搭建幾間小屋；處境不高，視野也無法開闊，與山居的初衷略有不符。",
      "output_sha256": "34066694a27dccef916e1cce7be2f720b36a9a35e81333672e687b3a2b40684b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": 0.551369,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3dc2f55bd1c9d98d4d2a0362b905f674debe98d026bff9ff6cda6c32b1d1419b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 22,
      "source_ai_sha256": "34066694a27dccef916e1cce7be2f720b36a9a35e81333672e687b3a2b40684b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        22
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "不久之前，更有幾位研究中國文學的外人來遊，我也照例的陪他們遊過吳山之後，他們問我說：“金人所說的立馬吳山第一峯，是什麼意思？”",
      "output_sha256": "cc08e86ae93e6bdcffbde7c083d678c610ed9654f365a018b22d8f06a0b8c6be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "cc08e86ae93e6bdcffbde7c083d678c610ed9654f365a018b22d8f06a0b8c6be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "他們以爲吳山總是杭州最高的山，所以金人會有這樣的詩語。",
      "output_sha256": "b6ef1500257be8ad1cc0885e856f100cae8ddfc524b7706e8a7c4b51ae7fc29d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "b6ef1500257be8ad1cc0885e856f100cae8ddfc524b7706e8a7c4b51ae7fc29d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "我一時無法解答，便指向了一排南宋故宮的遺跡。",
      "output_sha256": "fc11a0ab4e3acfe7fda91c7ffb2c3c5f832faab76d29ee833a0b7192cc6c8ecb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.592235,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
